---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About Us — Car PDI Checklist" description="Learn about the mission behind the Car PDI Checklist and why we built India's smartest car inspection tool.">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);">
    <h1 class="display-lg" style="margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xs);">About Us</h1>
    <p class="body-md" style="color: var(--color-muted); max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto;">India's smartest car inspection tool.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--spacing-md);">
    <p class="body-md" style="margin: 0;">Welcome to <strong>Car PDI Checklist</strong>, India’s smartest and most comprehensive Pre-Delivery Inspection tool for new car buyers.</p>
    
    <h2 class="title-md">Our Mission</h2>
    <p class="body-md" style="margin: 0;">Taking delivery of a new car is a monumental and joyous occasion. Unfortunately, it is also a time when buyers are most vulnerable. Every day in India, buyers unknowingly take delivery of vehicles with transit damage, repainted panels, electrical faults, or older manufacturing dates.</p>
    <p class="body-md" style="margin: 0;">Our mission is simple: <strong>To empower every car buyer with the knowledge and tools of an expert mechanic.</strong> We want to ensure that the car you pay for is exactly what you get—flawless and factory-fresh.</p>
    
    <h2 class="title-md">Why We Built This Tool</h2>
    <p class="body-md" style="margin: 0;">The Car PDI Checklist was born out of frustration. When our founder attempted to purchase a new car, the dealership tried to deliver an old, heavily driven (167 km) demo car with stained interiors, old tires, and hidden fees—refusing a pre-delivery inspection until confronted directly.</p>
    <p class="body-md" style="margin: 0;">By standing firm, demanding a proper inspection, and decoding the vehicle's manufacturing details, we forced the dealer to replace it with a truly factory-fresh car with only 21 km on the odometer.</p>
    <p class="body-md" style="margin: 0;">
      You can read the full, step-by-step account of this experience in <a href="/stories/my-story" style="color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid transparent; transition: border-bottom-color 0.2s ease;" onmouseover="this.style.borderBottomColor='var(--color-primary)'" onmouseout="this.style.borderBottomColor='transparent'">My Story: How a Dealership Tried to Scam Me</a>.
    </p>
    <p class="body-md" style="margin: 0;">We built this interactive, offline-capable digital tool to guide you step-by-step through the same checks, ensuring you never get stuck with a defective or pre-used vehicle.</p>
    
    <h2 class="title-md">Built for India</h2>
    <p class="body-md" style="margin: 0;">From dealing with dealership pressure to understanding the specific VIN formats of Maruti, Hyundai, Tata, and Mahindra, our tool is tailored specifically for the Indian automotive market.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
